# Paired A/B contact sheets (tools/ab-sheet.mjs). The sheet, its manifest and
# the index that maps them to REVIEW_QUEUE lines are what a look decision is
# taken from, so they are worth their bytes in history; the individual
# full-size frames beside them are regenerable from the manifest's scene, tier
# and parameters, and are not. That now includes the determinism baseline,
# which used to ride inside the manifest as 4.6 MB of base64 and is written out
# as an ordinary frame instead.
#
# Stated as a PATTERN rather than one directory at a time. The previous form
# needed four lines per sheet, which is exactly the trap this allowlist sets: a
# sheet added without them stays untracked while the suite passes locally.
!evidence/ab/
evidence/ab/*
!evidence/ab/legacy-tone-curve/
evidence/ab/legacy-tone-curve/*
!evidence/ab/legacy-tone-curve/legacyToneCurve-sheet.png
